      "id": "doc_9am8qzznmt8ruar7",
      "title": "District Disaster Management Authority Cyclone Preparedness Alert",
      "name": "District disaster weather alert.txt",
      "text": "District Disaster Management Authority Cyclone Preparedness Alert\nIssued on 20 September 2026 for coastal blocks. Citizens in low-lying areas must move to shelters by 6 PM. Emergency helpline 1077 will operate continuously. Fishing activity is suspended until 22 September 2026. Schools in affected blocks remain closed on 21 September 2026. [1] Section: Public Safety Advisory.",
