      "content": "Citizen Simplifier for Citizen\n\n1. Government Welfare Scheme Notification 2026 [1]\n2. The Department of Social Welfare launched the Suraksha Benefit Scheme on 1 August 2026. [2]\n3. Eligible households with annual income below INR 2,50,000 may apply through district service centres. [3]\n4. Applications close on 20 September 2026. [4]\n5. The scheme provides a one-time benefit of INR 10,000 after verification. [5]\n6. District officers must publish beneficiary lists within 30 days. [6]\n7. Section: Eligibility and Benefits. [7]\n\nRecommended communication objective: deliver accurate, source-grounded information in a simple tone for Website.",
